From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psigod <psigod@example.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:29:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] lk2nd: Bring up USB on the Galaxy Tab S3

The USB data lines of the Tab S3 go through the SM5705 MUIC, and the
SuperSpeed lanes through a Type-C switch lk2nd doesn't set up. Route
USB through the MUIC and run the controller at high speed only
(lk2nd,usb-high-speed-only), as lk2nd-v1 does (wt-preview
lk2nd/preview-base.patch, ported to this base).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: psigod <psigod@example.com>
---
